OL,3,ARacism, misogyny and homophobia remain
OL,4,Ain Met force, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new report has found institutional
OL,7,Fracism, misogyny and homophobia still
OL,8,Fexist in the Metropolitan Police, three
OL,9,Fyears after a damning review which
OL,10,Furged the force to make significant
OL,11,Fchanges.
OL,13,FThe Met has failed to make good
OL,14,Fprogress in all areas flagged as
OL,15,Fneeding improvement.
OL,17,FThe landmark report by Dr Gillian
OL,18,FFairfield has been looking at how much
OL,19,Fthe UK's biggest police force has
OL,20,Fchanged since Baroness Louise Casey's
OL,21,Fscathing review in 2023.
